--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party notices
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Icon path data — none redistributed
    This repository contains no third-party icon artwork. The contact and
    platform marks are fetched from the Iconify API (https://iconify.design)
    into a generated templates/icons.typ at the moment a CV is built, by
    scripts/harvest_icons.py; that file is not committed. The sets drawn from
    (Bootstrap Icons, Tabler Icons, Phosphor) are MIT and each remains under
    its own licence, restated in the header of the generated file. A licence
    covers the drawing, not the trademark.

Typefaces
    No font binaries are distributed with this skill. The font pools in
    scripts/pick_design.py name faces that are either packaged by common Linux
    distributions or available from Google Fonts under the SIL Open Font
    License 1.1. See references/fonts.md for provenance, licences and
    installation. Each face remains under its own licence.
